Initial commit: payabl. API Tester v6.17

Streamlit utility for exercising the payabl. gateway API (HPP Init,
Apple Pay / Google Pay / Trustly / PayPal direct payments, Authorize,
Pre-Authorize, Capture and Diagnose) against Sandbox or Production.

Includes, on top of v6.16.1:
- Capture Transaction ID field now follows the latest transaction ID
- Fresh Order ID after each send, plus a regenerate button
- Per-request LIVE confirmation gating all send buttons in Production
- Client-side validation (amount, required fields, Luhn, expiry, CVC),
  switchable in Sandbox, always on in Production
- pytest suite covering validation and UI flows with the gateway mocked

Repository hygiene: .gitignore, .gitattributes, restructured README,
version history in CHANGELOG.md.

